        "title": "Materials & Construction",
        "content": "Solid domestic hardwood (cherry, walnut, white oak, or maple depending on selection). Traditional joinery throughout \u2014 mortise-and-tenon, dovetail, and doweled construction. Finished with catalyzed lacquer or hand-rubbed oil for lasting protection. Zero particle board, zero MDF, zero veneer."
